<title>GERMANY: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ZWIESEL, Germany 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unofficial first leg placings in the fifth women's World Cup giant slalom of the season on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Anita Wachter (Austria) one minute 4.35 seconds</p>
<p>2. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) 1:04.39</p>
<p>3. Katja Seizinger (Germany) 1:04.42</p>
<p>4. Karin Roten (Switzerland) 1:04.55</p>
<p>5. Martina Ertl (Germany) 1:04.82</p>
<p>6. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) 1:05.03</p>
<p>7. Heidi Zurbriggen (Switzerland) 1:05.17</p>
<p>8. Sonja Nef (Switzerland) 1:05.84</p>
<p>9. Urska Hrovat (Slovenia) 1:05.97</p>
<p>10. Sophie Lefranc (France) 1:06.30.</p>
<p>First leg placings were declared official.</p>
</text>
